/*
Problem: Triangle Judgement
LeetCode #610

Determine whether three side lengths can form a triangle.

Triangle condition:
The sum of any two sides must be greater than
the remaining side.

Approach:
IF + Logical Conditions

Check all three triangle inequalities and return
"Yes" if they form a valid triangle, otherwise "No".
*/

SELECT *,
    IF(
        x + y > z
        AND y + z > x
        AND x + z > y,
        'Yes',
        'No'
    ) AS triangle
FROM Triangle;
